The `egolint-full` container is built on MegaLinter. MegaLinter is distributed
under AGPL-3.0-only and is available at
https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/tree/v10.0.0. This repository
explicitly ships the full license text at `LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt` and
copies it into the full image. The full image preserves MegaLinter's runtime
